 "description": "Get latest or specific block data including gas, transactions, and timestamps. Use for exact latest or historical block facts on one chain, including block number, gas, transactions, and timestamps. Do not use it for an aggregate chain health view; use chain.health for a single chain or oracle.chain_status for multi-chain status.",
